<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Multicanal raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Multicanal raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its near-term rating on Multicanal Holdings Inc to near-term buy from accumulate and kept its long-term rating a buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We rate the stock buy and urge investors to take advantage of the recent weakness in the shares,&quot; the brokerage said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 7/64 at 12-3/8.</p>
</text>
